          "The Net Worth Method operates on basic economic conservation: in any given year, an individual's total wealth accumulation plus personal consumption must equal their legitimate after-tax income plus gifts or inheritances. Any substantial discrepancy represents unexplained illicit wealth.",
          "The forensic equation calculates: (Current Period Assets - Current Period Liabilities) - (Base Period Assets - Base Period Liabilities) = Net Worth Increase. Adding documented annual living expenses (luxury vehicles, private aviation, real estate mortgages) yields Total Wealth Accretion and Consumption.",
