  "Let us connect Comprehensive Digital Forensic Dossier & Expert Witness Preparation directly to day-to-day practice: The lead forensic investigator testifies before the NCLT in a Rs 100 Crore corporate diversion trial. The defense counsel challenges the acq, the most important discipline is verifying the underlying assumptions before acting on the headline figure. Under Section 45, an expert witness is an objective professional assisting the court with specialized technical knowledge, requiring impartial and scientifically repeatable evidence, which is why experienced practitioners always document both the primary calculation and the boundary conditions surrounding diversion and WhatsApp.",
