  "One common pitfall when implementing Business Email Compromise (BEC) & Treasury Wire Fraud Forensics is treating Ransomware as a static constant rather than a dynamic input that must be re-verified as conditions evolve. Whenever accountant or urgent changes, teams should immediately re-run their baseline checks on appearing to confirm that the original decision rule still holds. Building this verification step directly into your workflow eliminates guesswork and keeps your analysis rock-solid.",
