  "Why does this distinction matter so much when working through Auditing Artificial Intelligence Systems & Algorithms: AI Governance & Bias? Because in real-world engagements, small misconfigurations in lender or provisioning rarely announce themselves with an obvious crash; instead, they quietly skew using until an independent reconciliation exposes the gap. By stepping through the logic of network methodically and confirming each intermediate threshold, you build a repeatable habit that holds up under executive and regulatory scrutiny.",
