      "example": "At Apex Omniverse, management booked $38.7M of adjustments, leaving $8.5M on the SUD (well below $36.0M PM), authorizing an Unqualified Opinion with a Going Concern explanatory paragraph, and establishing three global CAMs across Goodwill, ASC 606 Revenue, and Deferred Tax Assets.",
